# PlayerEscortExit's (81:E730) two arms no play reaches, from its walk out
# of level $12 as in cov_escort_exit.box (the camera's scroll x put just
# short of the exit spot, Aladdin 192 pixels right of it; one frame on,
# LevelExitCheck has set his code to $E730 and LevelExitReached has
# rewritten LEVEL_035C to 5).
# 1. LEVEL_035C set to 1 before his code runs: the walk at speed $28,
#    accel $57 (81:E744-E74D). The game's own stores never leave it 1 here:
#    the escort levels (7, $12, $17, the table at $80:B96B) get 3, 5, 8.
# 2. Level $17 (the one escort level whose STAGE_GOES_ON entry, $C6F2+$17,
#    is 0) set at the frame the fade ends (TASK2_STATE 0 at frame 64): the
#    exit goes on at the story card (81:E7AB-E7B0, TaskExec StoryCardTask),
#    which shows part 5's card.
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a6_s0.state
wait 2
poke $001773 F0,1E
poke $0008E7 B0,1F
wait 1
poke $00035C 01
wait 120
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a6_s0.state
wait 2
poke $001773 F0,1E
poke $0008E7 B0,1F
wait 63
poke $00035E 17,00
wait 400
